## Summary of Findings

### 1. JacksonInject and JacksonInject.Value in Jackson 2.10.2

**JAR location:** `/root/.m2/repository/com/fasterxml/jackson/core/jackson-annotations/2.10.2/jackson-annotations-2.10.2.jar`

The JAR contains two class files:
