- `com/fasterxml/jackson/annotation/JacksonInject$Value.class` (the value holder)

**`JacksonInject` annotation:**
```java
public interface JacksonInject extends Annotation {
    String value();
    OptBoolean useInput();
}
```

**`JacksonInject.Value` class** (full API):
```java
