**`/root/druid/core/src/main/java/org/apache/druid/guice/GuiceAnnotationIntrospector.java`** -- Extends `NopAnnotationIntrospector` and overrides only `findInjectableValueId`:

```java
public class GuiceAnnotationIntrospector extends NopAnnotationIntrospector {
    @Override
    public Object findInjectableValueId(AnnotatedMember m) {
        if (m.getAnnotation(JacksonInject.class) == null) {
